Rules/Domain/CreatureType: Kreaturentypen
Rules/Domain/Damage: Schaden
Rules/Domain/Dice: Würfel
Rules/Domain/Language: Sprachen
Rules/Domain/Length: Länge
Rules/Domain/Mechanics: Spielmechanik
Rules/Domain/School: Schulen der Magie
